{"uid":"a5384bc6ada69405","name":"test_a_deferred_but_not_yet_flushed_redelivery_still_blocks_the_terminal_gate","fullName":"tests.test_steer#test_a_deferred_but_not_yet_flushed_redelivery_still_blocks_the_terminal_gate","historyId":"065199c507748a7e758a0da709f77a97","time":{"start":1791880882537,"stop":1791880882569,"duration":32},"description":"PRD requirement D.6 (#184): D.4 changes WHEN a withheld message is\n    redelivered, never whether an outstanding message blocks the run's own\n    ending. Right after `_handle_unsettled_steering` counts an honest\n    `settled: false` but before `_flush_deferred_steering_redelivery` ever\n    runs (the exact window `STEER_DEFERRED_REDELIVERY_STATUS_KEY`'s queue\n    exists for, task 014/D.4), `steering/.consumed.json` still lists the\n    file consumed, so a bare `pending_steering()` read is blind to it.\n    Without this task, `_terminal_success_blockers()` -- the ONE predicate\n    both exit-gate sites consult (task 013/I) -- would read empty in that\n    exact window, letting a VERIFIED verdict make the run terminal-\n    succeeded with the message only deferred, never actually settled.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>PRD requirement D.6 (#184): D.4 changes WHEN a withheld message is<br />\nredelivered, never whether an outstanding message blocks the run's own<br />\nending. Right after <code>_handle_unsettled_steering</code> counts an honest<br />\n<code>settled: false</code> but before <code>_flush_deferred_steering_redelivery</code> ever<br />\nruns (the exact window <code>STEER_DEFERRED_REDELIVERY_STATUS_KEY</code>'s queue<br />\nexists for, task 014/D.4), <code>steering/.consumed.json</code> still lists the<br />\nfile consumed, so a bare <code>pending_steering()</code> read is blind to it.<br />\nWithout this task, <code>_terminal_success_blockers()</code> -- the ONE predicate<br />\nboth exit-gate sites consult (task 013/I) -- would read empty in that<br />\nexact window, letting a VERIFIED verdict make the run terminal-<br />\nsucceeded with the message only deferred, never actually settled.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791880795099,"stop":1791880795099,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791880795100,"stop":1791880795100,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791880882528,"stop":1791880882528,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791880882529,"stop":1791880882531,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791880882531,"stop":1791880882531,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791880882532,"stop":1791880882534,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_wait_out_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791880882534,"stop":1791880882534,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachment